OL,3,A'We just want to get home' - dozens
OL,4,Astranded in Tunisia after cancelled
OL,5,ABelfast flight
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome told BBC News NI of passengers
OL,8,Frunning out of medication since the
OL,9,Fcancellation on Saturday, while others
OL,10,Fcriticised EasyJet over a lack of
OL,11,Fsupport and communication.
OL,13,FEasyJet has said it is operating an
OL,14,Fadditional direct flight to Belfast on
OL,15,FTuesday night, and that it was "very
OL,16,Fsorry" for the inconvenience.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
